{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type StringCollationConfig = \n  | {\n  stringSort?: \"lexical\";\n}\n  | {\n  locale?: string;\n  localeOptions?: object;\n  stringSort?: \"locale\";\n}\n  | {\n  compare: (a, b) => number;\n  stringSort: \"custom\";\n};","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L34","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/types.ts:34"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"StringCollationConfig - Options for string sorting behavior"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This discriminated union allows for three types of string sorting:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lexical"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Simple character-by-character comparison"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Locale"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Locale-aware sorting with optional customization"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Custom"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Local comparison by a stable user-provided function reference"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Custom comparators must remain deterministic and immutable for their lifetime.\nRuntime query and index identity uses the exact function reference."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype StringCollationConfig = \n  | {\n  stringSort?: \"lexical\";\n}\n  | {\n  locale?: string;\n  localeOptions?: object;\n  stringSort?: \"locale\";\n}\n  | {\n  compare: (a, b) => number;\n  stringSort: \"custom\";\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:34](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L34)\n\nStringCollationConfig - Options for string sorting behavior\n\nThis discriminated union allows for three types of string sorting:\n- **Lexical**: Simple character-by-character comparison\n- **Locale**: Locale-aware sorting with optional customization\n- **Custom**: Local comparison by a stable user-provided function reference\n\nCustom comparators must remain deterministic and immutable for their lifetime.\nRuntime query and index identity uses the exact function reference.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: StringCollationConfig\ntitle: StringCollationConfig\n---\n\n```ts\ntype StringCollationConfig = \n  | {\n  stringSort?: \"lexical\";\n}\n  | {\n  locale?: string;\n  localeOptions?: object;\n  stringSort?: \"locale\";\n}\n  | {\n  compare: (a, b) => number;\n  stringSort: \"custom\";\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/types.ts:34](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/types.ts#L34)\n\nStringCollationConfig - Options for string sorting behavior\n\nThis discriminated union allows for three types of string sorting:\n- **Lexical**: Simple character-by-character comparison\n- **Locale**: Locale-aware sorting with optional customization\n- **Custom**: Local comparison by a stable user-provided function reference\n\nCustom comparators must remain deterministic and immutable for their lifetime.\nRuntime query and index identity uses the exact function reference.\n"}
